# Blurancy Cartify

Production-oriented e-commerce project.

## Features

- 100 products
- Product search
- Category filtering
- Price filtering
- Shopping cart
- Phone OTP authentication
- Supabase integration
- PayU hosted checkout structure
- Server-side PayU hash generation
- Server-side product/price validation
- Supabase order persistence
- PayU callback endpoints
- PayU webhook endpoint

