## IMPORTANT

Do not put PayU Live Salt in app.js.

Do not put Supabase service-role/secret key in app.js.

Do not commit backend/.env to GitHub.


## Frontend configuration

Open:

assets/app.js

Set:

SUPABASE_URL =
"YOUR_REAL_SUPABASE_PROJECT_URL";

SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY =
"YOUR_REAL_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY";

API_BASE_URL =
"YOUR_REAL_HTTPS_BACKEND_URL";


## Backend configuration

Create:

backend/.env

Set:

PAYU_KEY=
YOUR_REAL_PAYU_LIVE_KEY

PAYU_SALT=
YOUR_REAL_PAYU_LIVE_SALT

SUPABASE_URL=
YOUR_REAL_SUPABASE_PROJECT_URL

SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
YOUR_SERVER_ONLY_SUPABASE_SECRET

BACKEND_URL=
YOUR_REAL_HTTPS_BACKEND_URL


## Supabase

Run backend/supabase.sql
in the Supabase SQL editor.


## PayU

Configure the following URLs
in the PayU merchant dashboard:

Success:

https://YOUR-BACKEND-DOMAIN/api/payu/success

Failure:

https://YOUR-BACKEND-DOMAIN/api/payu/failure

Webhook:

https://YOUR-BACKEND-DOMAIN/api/payu/webhook


## Before accepting real payments

Complete:

1. PayU merchant activation
2. PayU Live Key/Salt
3. HTTPS backend deployment
4. Supabase database
5. PayU webhook configuration
6. Payment response verification
7. Payment verification/reconciliation
8. Real product images
9. Privacy Policy
10. Terms and Conditions
11. Refund/Return Policy
12. Shipping Policy
13. Contact page
